4035c><div class="e-card--elevation-0 e-card" data-test-id="e-card" data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card__body" data-test-id="card-body" data-v-4984035c><!--[--><div class="card__image" data-v-e1e30b9c><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z7b7mJ7c43Q3f_8q_EVRI_LOCATION_04_5681-1-a942.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z7b7mJ7c43Q3f_8q_EVRI_LOCATION_04_5681-1-.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z7b7mJ7c43Q3f_8q_EVRI_LOCATION_04_5681-1-.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z7b7mJ7c43Q3f_8q_EVRI_LOCATION_04_5681-1-.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="A side-view profile of a customer sitting on a sofa, with a laptop resting on their lap as they look down at the screen." width="1000" height="666" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-e1e30b9c></div><div class="card__content" data-v-e1e30b9c><!----><div class="card__content--text" data-v-e1e30b9c><h2 class="card__title u-font-style-h3" data-v-e1e30b9c>What are BRIC countries?</h2><div class="card__text" data-v-e1e30b9c><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->The BRIC countries are Brazil, Russia, India, and China. These nations are important for businesses because they have large, fast-growing economies with increasing consumer spending. Expanding to BRIC countries can open up new markets, offering opportunities to sell products and services to a wider audience. For businesses looking to grow internationally, a higher demand for exports and increasing economic growth  make these countries more attractive.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->We’ve put this guide together to help you understand what a BRIC country is, so you know how to get started in these markets and include them in your business strategy.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!----><!----></div></div><!--]--></div><!----></div><!----></div><!--]--><dialog class="e-modal frequent-seller-signup-modal" data-test-id="modal-card" aria-label="Your Frequent Seller account is nearly ready" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-d4c8c135 data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__content" data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__header" data-v-a7583600><!----></div><div class="e-avatar e-avatar--size-m e-avatar--color-brand-01-tint-5 e-avatar-bordered e-avatar-bordered--neutral-05 e-modal__avatar" style="" data-test-id="modal-avatar" aria-hidden="true" data-v-a7583600 data-v-4b59c4a2><!----><div class="e-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="success" data-test-id="avatar-icon" data-v-4b59c4a2 data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="32" width="32" style="line-height:32px" viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>Success</title> <path opacity="0.2" d="M7.3 25.76C-0.35 18.92 3.31 7.11 9.69 4C4.74 22.65 20.04 26.54 28 21.87C26.41 27.31 14.94 32.6 7.3 25.76Z" fill="#006BAA"/> <path d="M24.76 11.75L13.6 22.91L7.24 16.55L8.35 15.44L13.6 20.69L23.65 10.64L24.76 11.75Z" fill="#006BAA"/> <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M16 1.71C23.88 1.71 30.29 8.12 30.29 16C30.29 23.88 23.88 30.29 16 30.29C8.12 30.29 1.71 23.88 1.71 16C1.71 8.12 8.12 1.71 16 1.71ZM16 3.27C8.98 3.27 3.27 8.98 3.27 16C3.27 23.02 8.98 28.73 16 28.73C23.02 28.73 28.73 23.02 28.73 16C28.73 8.98 23.02 3.27 16 3.27Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </svg></div><!----></div><h2 class="e-modal__heading" data-test-id="heading" data-v-a7583600>Your Frequent Seller account is nearly ready</h2><!----><div class="e-modal__slot-wrapper" data-test-id="slot-wrapper" data-v-a7583600><!--[--><div class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__content" data-v-d4c8c135><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__body" data-v-d4c8c135> We need to log you out to update your pricing. </p><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__body" data-v-d4c8c135> Simply log back in and start booking parcels to see your new discounts automatically applied. </p><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__countdown" aria-live="assertive" aria-atomic="true" data-v-d4c8c135> Logging you out in 10 seconds... </p></div><!--]--></div><!----></div></dialog><!--]--></div></section><section id="why-are-bric-countries-important?" class="section-wrapper" index="2" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><h2 class="section__title" data-v-e1e30b9c>Why are BRIC countries important?</h2><div class="section__description" data-v-e1e30b9c><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->For UK-based smaller businesses, tapping into BRIC markets can provide significant growth opportunities.  Read more below to learn about the unique potential each BRIC country can offer your business and how Evri can help you start shipping.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!--[--><div data-v-e1e30b9c><!--[--><div class="e-card-wrapper card card--multi card--multi-quantity" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card--elevation-0 e-card" data-test-id="e-card" data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card__body" data-test-id="card-body" data-v-4984035c><!--[--><div class="card__image" data-v-e1e30b9c><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z2Vip5bqstJ98uso_Brazila942.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z2Vip5bqstJ98uso_Brazil.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z2Vip5bqstJ98uso_Brazil.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z2Vip5bqstJ98uso_Brazil.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt width="1000" height="670" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-e1e30b9c></div><div class="card__content" data-v-e1e30b9c><h3 class="card__title" data-v-e1e30b9c>Brazil</h3><div class="card__text" data-v-e1e30b9c><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Brazil, with a population of over 213 million, is the largest country in South America. It has a diverse and growing economy, known for its strong agriculture, mining, and manufacturing sectors. Brazil&#39;s e-commerce market is booming, making it an excellent opportunity for small businesses to enter. The country is also rich in natural resources, providing unique opportunities in sectors like food and beverages, fashion, and technology.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Shipping to Brazil takes as little as 13-16 days and from £9.79. Find out more about <!--]--><!--]--><a href="/our-services/international-courier-services/brazil" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->sending parcels to Brazil<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> with our guide.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div><!--]--></div><!----></div><!----></div><div class="e-card-wrapper card card--multi card--multi-quantity" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card--elevation-0 e-card" data-test-id="e-card" data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card__body" data-test-id="card-body" data-v-4984035c><!--[--><div class="card__image" data-v-e1e30b9c><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z5uKoZbqstJ9-DAR_Customerreceivingparcel-2-a942.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z5uKoZbqstJ9-DAR_Customerreceivingparcel-2-.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z5uKoZbqstJ9-DAR_Customerreceivingparcel-2-.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z5uKoZbqstJ9-DAR_Customerreceivingparcel-2-.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="A customer is standing in the doorway of their home, smiling as they are handed a parcel from the courier." width="1000" height="680" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-e1e30b9c></div><div class="card__content" data-v-e1e30b9c><h3 class="card__title" data-v-e1e30b9c>Russia</h3><div class="card__text" data-v-e1e30b9c><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Russia has a population of around 146 million and is known for its vast natural resources, particularly oil and gas. Its economy is recovering and diversifying, offering growth potential in technology, agriculture, and retail. Small businesses can benefit from Russia’s increasing demand for imported goods, especially in the technology and luxury markets. The e-commerce sector is also expanding rapidly, providing opportunities for online retailers to tap into this market.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->We don’t currently provide international courier services to Russia, but we’ll review this once the political situation is safe for us to deliver here. Keep watching this space for updates.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div><!--]--></div><!----></div><!----></div><div class="e-card-wrapper card card--multi card--multi-quantity" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card--elevation-0 e-card" data-test-id="e-card" data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card__body" data-test-id="card-body" data-v-4984035c><!--[--><div class="card__image" data-v-e1e30b9c><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z2VjTZbqstJ98us8_Indiaa942.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z2VjTZbqstJ98us8_India.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z2VjTZbqstJ98us8_India.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z2VjTZbqstJ98us8_India.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt width="1000" height="670" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-e1e30b9c></div><div class="card__content" data-v-e1e30b9c><h3 class="card__title" data-v-e1e30b9c>India</h3><div class="card__text" data-v-e1e30b9c><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->India, with a population exceeding 1.4 billion, is one of the fastest-growing economies in the world. It boasts a young and tech-savvy population, driving growth in sectors like IT, telecommunications, and e-commerce. Small businesses can find opportunities in sectors like technology, fashion, and consumer goods. India&#39;s digital economy is also expanding, making it a prime market for online businesses and digital services.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->You can send a package to India in 9 to 16 days for only £10.96. Learn more about <!--]--><!--]--><a href="/our-services/international-courier-services/india" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->shipping to India<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> with our guide.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div><!--]--></div><!----></div><!----></div><div class="e-card-wrapper card card--multi card--multi-quantity" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card--elevation-0 e-card" data-test-id="e-card" data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card__body" data-test-id="card-body" data-v-4984035c><!--[--><div class="card__image" data-v-e1e30b9c><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/01c34b6b-0db6-4403-b292-2c58eeb0edcb_1000x670px_Chinaa942.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/01c34b6b-0db6-4403-b292-2c58eeb0edcb_1000x670px_China.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/01c34b6b-0db6-4403-b292-2c58eeb0edcb_1000x670px_China.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/01c34b6b-0db6-4403-b292-2c58eeb0edcb_1000x670px_China.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="Skyline photo of Beijing, China" width="1000" height="670" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-e1e30b9c></div><div class="card__content" data-v-e1e30b9c><h3 class="card__title" data-v-e1e30b9c>China</h3><div class="card__text" data-v-e1e30b9c><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Similarly to India, China is also populated with over 1.4 billion people. It has a rapidly growing economy, especially in manufacturing, technology, and e-commerce. China’s e-commerce sector is the largest in the world, providing vast opportunities for online retailers. China&#39;s focus on innovation and technology offers further unique opportunities in the tech and consumer electronics sectors.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Start sending parcels to China from only £7.71 and in 12-15 days! Discover more about how to <!--]--><!--]--><a href="/our-services/international-courier-services/china" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->send a parcel to China<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> in our guide.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div><!--]--></div><!----></div><!----></div><!--]--></div><!--]--><dialog class="e-modal frequent-seller-signup-modal" data-test-id="modal-card" aria-label="Your Frequent Seller account is nearly ready" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-d4c8c135 data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__content" data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__header" data-v-a7583600><!----></div><div class="e-avatar e-avatar--size-m e-avatar--color-brand-01-tint-5 e-avatar-bordered e-avatar-bordered--neutral-05 e-modal__avatar" style="" data-test-id="modal-avatar" aria-hidden="true" data-v-a7583600 data-v-4b59c4a2><!----><div class="e-i